{"code":"004105","name":"태양금속우","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1954년 태양자전거기업사로 시작해 1964년 태양금속공업주식회사로 법인 전환하고 상호 변경하였으며, 1976년 상장됨. 현재 (주)프라이맥스, 중국 내 연대태양금속유한공사, 태양프라이맥스기배유한공사, 인도 Taeyang Metal India 등 7개 계열사를 보유하고 있음. 자동차, 기계, 전기, 전자부품용 냉간단조제품을 제조하여 현대차, 기아, 현대모비스, HL만도 및 LG E&S에 공급하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-20","n_days":299,"close":4435.0,"open":4490.0,"high":4520.0,"low":4390.0,"volume":20838,"amount":92416530.0,"ret_1d":-1.1148,"gap":0.1115,"range_pct":2.9312,"ret_5":-4.7261,"ret_20":29.4891,"ret_60":48.8255,"ret_120":0.3394,"ret_250":39.685,"ma20":4253.25,"ma60":3436.0833,"ma120":3509.5417,"ma200":3566.475,"close_vs_ma200":24.3525,"close_vs_ma60":29.0714,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":1.0,"slope_60":1056.4672,"r2_60":0.8626,"slope_120":-5.899,"r2_120":0.0029,"slope_250":4.5442,"r2_250":0.0102,"high52":4895.0,"low52":2625.0,"pos_52w":79.7357,"dd_52w":-9.3973,"mdd_1y":-40.4396,"atr14_pct":6.7241,"vol_ann_60":44.4003,"vol_avg20":76381.25,"vol_ratio20":0.2728,"vr5":1.1972,"vr20":1.299,"amount_avg5":190604859.0,"amount_avg20":331347115.25,"amount_avg60":145655267.4167,"obv_chg20":49.4187,"turnover_20":46.2917,"pv_eff_20":0.637,"rsi14":61.9194,"frgn_net_5":-16510.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.5003,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.5003,"frgn_net_20":29555.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.8956,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.8956,"frgn_net_60":17990.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.5452,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.5452,"frgn_net_120":13687.0,"inst_net_120":-2.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.4148,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0001,"smart_net_120_pct":0.4147,"foreign_ratio":3.66,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.39,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":39.0,"op_margin_q":2.4482,"op_qoq":-36.0656,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":225.0,"rev_yoy":1.5296,"op_trend_4q":-1.3559,"fin_period":"202606","roe":12.47,"debt_ratio":259.04,"per":10.17,"pbr":1.0,"div_yiel